message: "If you reuse this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Du formulaire à la carte — Chindwin, Myanmar"
abstract: >-
  Presentation and temporal analysis of a transfer test of the Amazon Mining
  Watch model to the Chindwin, Myanmar. Nine dry seasons (2017–18 to 2025–26)
  show a stable mining core; the total patch count rises because the model also
  flags bare agricultural fields to the west. The test is exploratory and does
  not measure accuracy or causality.
